tk: PART II · DOSSIER 9 · ❖
big: Naomi
lede: Her whole future turns on a girl she's never met. If Eden wins, her mother enters her in the Trials. If Eden dies or is publicly rejected, her mother gets her out (FR 29).
calls:
k: On the record
Hannah's daughter, one year from the end of the Vowed education program (TL). Eligible for the Trials through her mother's household and standing (FR 31–32). She keeps the name Naomi (FR 33).
||
k: Still open
Her age, where she studies, what she wants, and whether she'd enter if nobody asked her.
/end

